# ============================================================
# Ignore EVERYTHING at top level, then whitelist project dirs
# (git is in the home dir, so we exclude personal files)
# ============================================================
/*

# Whitelist: project files we WANT in the repo
!.gitignore
!.github/
!.github/**
!terraform/
!skydash/
!deploy/
!Documentation/
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!DOCUMENTATION_REVIEW.md
!START_HERE.md
!AGENT_ONBOARDING.md
!TASKS.md
!STATUS.md

# ============================================================
# Re-ignore sensitive/junk INSIDE whitelisted dirs
# ============================================================

# Secrets — NEVER commit
terraform/.env
.env
.env.backup
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

# Terraform state & plugins
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/*.tfstate
terraform/*.tfstate*
terraform/*.tfstate.*
terraform/crash.log

# Python
skydash/venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
skydash/__pycache__/
skydash/**/__pycache__/

# Logs
*.log
skydash/flask.log
skydash/autostart.log

# Cline session data (large, private)
.cline/
